  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2fe0abe2bc63b4548846bb100704dbfe, type: 3}
  m_Name: StrawberryIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - The name is Agent Strawberry. We've received an anonymous tip that this business
    has been distributing peculiar products.
  - 'My my, what do we have here. Please, allow me to inspect that bizzare pink donut. '
  - The one with a hole in the center. It needs to be inspected immediately.
  responses:
  - responseText: You just want to eat it right?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 98df185d0eea17a4b8bbb700bc4fb76f, type: 2}
  - responseText: Is this proper business attire?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afb9e2c5bdefaaa4d9eccffd8bf000c5, type: 2}
